  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x8D25" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Idle Model - Duration [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0xF54E; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Duration of the trimmed valve event pair of the VVEL idle-model stage FUN_00057322, zero at 0x8000 and 0.05 per count, looked up by engine speed and the VVEL load word 0xFFFF238A. With ROM8[0x8957].bit5 set (stock 0x3A), the stage writes 0xFFFFA1DC = 0.05 * (raw - 0x8000) and places the trimmed events 0xFFFFA1E4 and 0xFFFFA1E8 at the trimmed center +/- 2 * 0xFFFFA1DC; with the bit clear, the value adds to 0.25 * (0xFFFFA1EC - 0xFFFFA1F0). FUN_00057208 blends the trimmed events toward the high-load pair, and the chain of FUN_00056BAA forms the mode 5 duration 0xFFFFA1B0. Stock 33428..34108 = 33.0..67.0. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0xf54e bound to accessor 0x57322 through literal 0x574f8. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: (x-32768)*0.05 deg; proposed editor-grid inverse x/0.05+32768. Origin: the float literals 0.05 at 0x57530 and -1638.4 at 0x57638. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
