  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xB914" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Idle Model - Intake Phase [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x10ACE; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Phase of the trimmed valve event pair of the VVEL idle-model stage FUN_00057322, zero at 0x8000 and 0.5 per count, looked up by engine speed and the VVEL load word 0xFFFF238A. With ROM8[0x8957].bit5 set (stock 0x3A), the stage writes 0xFFFFA1E0 = 0.5 * (raw - 0x8000) and centers the trimmed events 0xFFFFA1E4 and 0xFFFFA1E8 at 478 - 0xFFFFA1E0, where 478 = 450 + ROM16[0x8D8E] / 512; with the bit clear, the value adds to 478 - 0.5 * (0xFFFFA1EC + 0xFFFFA1F0). The mode 5 VTC target is 478 minus the mean of the blended events 0xFFFFA1B8 and 0xFFFFA1BC. Stock offsets are 0..120 counts. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x10ace bound to accessor 0x57322 through literal 0x57500. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: (x-32768)*0.5 degCA; proposed editor-grid inverse x*2+32768. Origin: the float literals 0.5 at 0x5750C and -16384.0 at 0x57640. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
