    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x13F90; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Threshold of the hot-intake idle latch in FUN_00059C2C while the knock state 0xFFFF23C6.bit6 is set; the reader adds 8 to the literal 0x00013F88. The rest of the latch follows 0x00013F88. Stock 90, 70, 50, 50, 50, 50, 50, 50. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x13f90 bound to accessor 0x59c2c through literal 0x59d90 + 0x8. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x counts of 0xFFFF268C; proposed editor-grid inverse x. Origin: the byte comparison in FUN_00059C2C. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
