  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1815" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Idle Model - High-Load Duration [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x16D34; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Duration of the high-load valve event pair of the VVEL idle-model stage FUN_00057208, looked up by engine speed. The stage places the high-load events 0xFFFFA1D4 and 0xFFFFA1D8 at C +/- 0.01 * raw, with C = 478 - 0.5 * (0x00016F14 - 0x8000), and blends them with the events 0xFFFFA1E4 and 0xFFFFA1E8 of FUN_00057322 by the load weight 0xFFFFA1D0. The half-span 0.01 * raw equals twice a duration of 0.005 * raw. Stock 10000..14400. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x16d34 bound to accessor 0x57208 through literal 0x574a8. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x*0.005 deg; proposed editor-grid inverse x/0.005. Origin: the float literal 0.01 at 0x574BC and the factor 2 of the event half-span in FUN_00057322. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
