  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xAEF9" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Idle Model - High-Load Phase [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x16F14; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Phase of the high-load valve event pair of the VVEL idle-model stage FUN_00057208, zero at 0x8000 and 0.5 per count, looked up by engine speed. The event center is C = 478 - 0.5 * (raw - 0x8000), where 478 = 450 + ROM16[0x8D8E] / 512. Stock offsets are 0..68 counts. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x16f14 bound to accessor 0x57208 through literal 0x574b4. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: (x-32768)*0.5 degCA; proposed editor-grid inverse x*2+32768. Origin: the float literals -0.5 at 0x574DC and 16834.0 at 0x574E4. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
