    <title>VVEL Duration Floor - Hot Intake Idle [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x1600A; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Eight-point lower bound of the mode 12 duration: the resolver takes the maximum of this curve and the surface 0x0000E1CE. Stock values are 900 = 45.0 at every point. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x1600a bound to accessor 0x564a4 through literal 0x56678 + 0x10. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x*0.05 deg; proposed editor-grid inverse x/0.05. Origin: the retained layout interpretation and defs/JK78C.vvel.md:409-441, defs/JK78C.vvel.md:478-505. The physical degree unit is not supplied by 900, 45.0 or the maximum operation. The returned table quantity is distinct from its axis-coordinate quantity and from the paired command-word domain. Recorded code and catalog interpretation: Read by the resolver FUN_000564A4 at callsite 0x5655E through the 8-point uint16 wrapper 0x282F4 as GBR + 0x10 with the axis at GBR + 0; GBR holds the literal 0x00015FFA loaded at 0x564BC from 0x56678. The coordinate is the demand word 0xFFFF2350 (DID 0x1218). Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
