  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x15BE" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Idle Model - High-Load Blend Start [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x162EA; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Load at which the VVEL idle-model stage FUN_00057208 starts to blend toward the high-load event pair, at 100/65536 percent per count and looked up by engine speed. The weight 0xFFFFA1D0 is (load - start) / (end - start), clamped to 0..1, with the VVEL load word 0xFFFF238A and the end curve 0x000162CA. The stage writes 0xFFFFA1C8 = w * upper + (1 - w) * 0xFFFFA1E4 and 0xFFFFA1CC = w * lower + (1 - w) * 0xFFFFA1E8. The reader addresses it at offset 0x20 from the literal 0x000162CA. Stock 61440 = 93.75 % through the eighth point, 57344 and 53248 at the ninth and tenth, and 1 above. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x162ea bound to accessor 0x57208 through literal 0x574a4 + 0x20. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x*100/65536 %; proposed editor-grid inverse x*65536/100. Origin: the float literal 100/65536 at 0x574C0. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
