  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xFAD5" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Idle Model - Duration Floor [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x16C64; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Duration floor of the VVEL idle-model stage FUN_00056DCA at 1/512 per count, looked up by engine speed. The stage engages the floor while its mode argument equals 5, the model duration does not exceed this value, the demand margin reaches ROM8[0x8B05] * 0.25 = 5.0, and the counter 0xFFFFA369 of passes with the demand argument above this value reaches ROM8[0x8B07] = 1. The idle-model duration 0xFFFFA1B0 is ((10000 - w) * d + w * max(d, floor)) / 10000, with d the model duration and w the floor weight. The stock floor is 21504 = 42.0 through the ninth point and 23296 = 45.5 above it. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x16c64 bound to accessor 0x56dca through literal 0x56f6c. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x/512 deg; proposed editor-grid inverse x*512. Origin: the float literal 1/512 at 0x56F4C. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
