  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x4BD6" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Idle Model - Floor Hold Passes [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x16D04; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Pass count of the full idle-model floor weight in FUN_00056DCA, looked up by the demand margin over the axis 0x00016BD4. While the floor is engaged, the weight is 10000 as long as the engaged-pass counter 0xFFFFA366 does not exceed this value; afterwards the weight 0xFFFFA35C steps down by 0x00016BE4 per pass. The weight is zero while the floor is not engaged. Stock 15, 17, 20, 20, 15, 10, 10, 10. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x16d04 bound to accessor 0x56dca through literal 0x571d8. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x passes; proposed editor-grid inverse x. Origin: the counter comparison in FUN_00056DCA. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
