  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x78F9" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Duration Target - Start-up [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x15E32; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Start-up duration 0xFFFFA194 used by modes 2 and 11: the curve by the selected temperature 0xFFFF1066 while 0xFFFF45CA.bit1 is clear, scaled by 0.05. With the bit set a ramp between ROM16[0x91C6] and ROM16[0x91C8] replaces the curve. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x15e32 bound to accessor 0x56ab4 through literal 0x56cb8. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x*0.05 deg; proposed editor-grid inverse x/0.05. Origin: the retained layout interpretation and defs/JK78C.vvel.md:409-441, defs/JK78C.vvel.md:478-505, vvel_duration_startup_axis/axis. The selected-temperature axis proof and startup selector do not establish the ordinate unit. The returned table quantity is distinct from its axis-coordinate quantity and from the paired command-word domain. Recorded code and catalog interpretation: Read by FUN_00056AB4 at callsite 0x56B7E through the 16-point uint16 wrapper 0x28320; the literal pool at 0x56CB8 follows FUN_00056BAA. The axis 0x00017204 = 10..160 is -40..110 degC. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
