    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x16BE4; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Per-pass decrement of the idle-model floor weight 0xFFFFA35C in FUN_00056DCA after the hold of 0x00016D04, looked up by the demand margin over the axis 0x00016BD4; the full weight is 10000. The reader addresses it at offset 0x10 from the literal 0x00016BD4. Stock 500, 500, 500, 500, 700, 1500, 1500, 1500. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x16be4 bound to accessor 0x56dca through literal 0x571dc + 0x10. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x/10000 of the full weight; proposed editor-grid inverse x. Origin: the weight literal 10000 at 0x57068. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
