    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x1034E; 8 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Duration word surface of the state-code dispatcher FUN_000657E4 for state codes 6 and 7; FUN_0004692A assigns code 5 to VVEL mode 12, code 6 to mode 13, and code 7 to mode 14 from the published mode byte 0xFFFF2808; mode 14 is unreachable on JK78C, so code 7 is never produced. Stock values span 900..1180 = 45.0..59.0. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x1034e bound to accessor 0x657e4 through literal 0x66674. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x*0.05 deg; proposed editor-grid inverse x/0.05. Origin: the retained layout interpretation and defs/JK78C.vvel.md:409-441, defs/JK78C.vvel.md:478-505. Shared dispatcher and axis inputs do not establish physical degrees for this returned word. The returned table quantity is distinct from its axis-coordinate quantity and from the paired command-word domain. Recorded code and catalog interpretation: Read by FUN_000657E4 at callsites 0x664B8 and 0x66578, where r4 holds the surface selected before the call through the 8x8 uint16 wrapper 0x28058 with the coordinates and axes of the state code 5 surface 0x000102CE. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
