    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x16A94; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Mode 3 intake-cam target of the VVEL selector, interpolated by coolant temperature and gated by the flag 0xFFFFA362 with hysteresis ROM8[0x8AA7] = 53 and ROM8[0x8AA8] = 0. Stock values are 0x8000 = 0 at every point. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x16a94 bound to accessor 0x56a14 through literal 0x56c88 + 0x40. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: (x-32768)*0.5 degCA; proposed editor-grid inverse x*2+32768. Origin: the retained layout interpretation and defs/JK78C.vvel.md:409-428, defs/JK78C.vvel.md:495-505. The resolver arithmetic establishes a centered numeric output only where the recorded conversion path is given. It does not establish physical camshaft/crankshaft degrees. Uniform zero counts cannot prove a slope. A proved RPM or temperature coordinate does not prove the table output unit. Recorded code and catalog interpretation: Read by FUN_00056A14 at callsite 0x56A4A through the 8-point uint16 wrapper 0x282F4 as the base literal 0x00016A54 + 0x40 with the axis at + 0x70. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
