  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x554F" flags="0x0">
    <title>Intake CVTC State Word - Idle Model and Running [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x104CE; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Intake VTC state word of the state codes 2 and 8 (VVEL modes 5 and 15) in FUN_000657E4, read over the axes of 0x000100CE while 0xFFFF23CB.bit7 is set; with the bit clear the word is zero. The dispatcher publishes the VTC word 0xFFFF122E from the current and previous codes like the duration word. 0xFFFF23CB.bit7 is written by FUN_000E59F8. The stock cells range 0..120 and the first two of the 16 rows are zero, so the stock VTC word follows this surface while the bit is set. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x104ce bound to accessor 0x657e4 through literal 0x66694. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x*0.5 degCA; proposed editor-grid inverse x/0.5. Origin: the zero-phase fallback of the VTC word in FUN_000657E4. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
