  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x8121" flags="0x0">
    <title>Intake CVTC State Word - Default and Cold Modes [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x106CE; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Intake VTC state word of the state codes 1 and 3 in FUN_000657E4: the VVEL mode 3 and every mode without its own code, whose duration word comes from 0x00016D14. The dispatcher reads it over the axes of 0x000100CE while 0xFFFF23CB.bit7 is set; with the bit clear the word is zero. The stock cells range 0..68 and the first two of the 16 rows are zero, so the stock VTC word follows this surface while the bit is set. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x106ce bound to accessor 0x657e4 through literal 0x666a0. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x*0.5 degCA; proposed editor-grid inverse x/0.5. Origin: the zero-phase fallback of the VTC word in FUN_000657E4. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
