  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x423B" flags="0x0">
    <title>Fuel Composite - Additional Multiplier [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0xA38A; 8 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Additional unsigned multiplier in FUN_0006e4f6. The output of this explicit 8x8 byte surface multiplies the product of implicit surface 0000a34a and word curve 0001608a; the complete product is shifted right by 14, capped to uint16 and published at ffff1666. The separate lookup byte is stored at ffff1668. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0xa38a bound to accessor 0x6e4f6 through literal 0x6e6c8. The active reader uses wrapper 00027ee0 with two explicit eight-byte axes and byte bilinear row stride 8. Coordinates derive from words ffff33a6 and ffff33a4 through helper 00021ce8, subtract 220 and 420 respectively and clamp the signed intermediates to 0..255. Inputs and output retain stored-count presentation; physical input quantities and an engineering output conversion remain unresolved. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
