    <title>Intake CVTC - Hold Duty [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x1204E; 8 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Hold duty of the intake CVTC solenoids. FUN_000E841A stores x / 65536 in 0xFFFFAA58 and adds it to the term of each bank before FUN_000E9310 forms the duty outputs 0xFFFF44BC and 0xFFFF44BE, which FUN_000E946C writes to the duty words 0xFFFF25C4 and 0xFFFF25C6. Stock 35193..37355 = 0.537..0.570. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x1204e bound to accessor 0xe841a through literal 0xe8578. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x/65536; proposed editor-grid inverse x*65536. Origin: the float literal 0x377FFFFF, 1/65536 less one unit in the last place, at 0xE857C. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
