  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xE528" flags="0x0">
    <title>Intake CVTC - Target Upper Bound [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x16AA4; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Upper bound of the intake CVTC target word 0xFFFF227C. FUN_000E6492 looks up this curve over the axis 0x00016B94 by the larger of the words 0xFFFF2674 and 0xFFFF2676, stores the result in 0xFFFF1ACE, and writes 0xFFFF227C = min(selected target, bound) on every path; the default selected target is 0x8000. The stock cells hold 32898 = 0x8000 + 130 through the sixth point and fall to 32798 = 0x8000 + 30 at the last. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x16aa4 bound to accessor 0xe6492 through literal 0xe65c8. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x-32768 counts; proposed editor-grid inverse x+32768. Origin: the default target 0x8000 of FUN_000E6492. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
