    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x14120; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Gain curve of FUN_000657E4 indexed by byte ffff119d and cached at ffff1387. It scales the wide signed difference in the state path that is centered at raw 64, followed by slew and byte bounds. The coefficient is an operational gain, without an inferred engineering timing unit. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x14120 bound to accessor 0x657e4 through literal 0x65a58. Stock lookup status: active. ROM8[00008965] = 0xBA has bit 5 set. The periodic state compositor samples this gain before its state-code dispatch; the gain is not evidence of a physical timing conversion. Stored counts are retained. Physical quantities and engineering conversions are unresolved. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
