    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0xA78A; 8 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Primary timing-state surface for state codes 6 and 7 with ffff23c6.bit6 either. FUN_000657E4 uses the ROM8[00008965].bit5-set compositor. On the stock state-dispatch path ROM8[00008966].bit4 is set: both current code ffff43f2 and saved code ffff4480 are evaluated, then selected or blended according to ffff2814. The bit-clear path also evaluates its two endpoint samples. The alternative bank selector is ffff23c6.bit6; input load may be forced to 255 by the separate override gate. Stored-byte timing units are not established here. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0xa78a bound to accessor 0x657e4 through literal 0x65c9c, accessor 0x657e4 through literal 0x65ef0. Stock lookup status: unqualified. ROM8[00008965] = 0xBA enables the state compositor. The table identity and lookup operands are qualified; the stock lifecycle of the selecting bank, flag or state code is not qualified for this individual calibration. Lookup correspondence alone does not establish stock activation. Stock activation remains unqualified under issue #129. Stored counts are retained. Physical quantities and engineering conversions are unresolved. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
