  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xDB87" flags="0x0">
    <title>Timing Float Attenuation Factor A [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x14C8C; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. First attenuation factor of the attenuated-product builder. Its scaled word multiplies the second attenuation factor; the reader forms a bounded one-minus-product term and applies it to the branch output. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0x14c8c bound to accessor 0x59204 through literal 0x5930c + 0x80. Stock lookup status: active. Scheduler entry 00021b88 runs 00068af8, which calls the float consumer 00058d98 unconditionally at 00068b06; reader 00059204 reads this role without a calibration branch. The consumer publishes byte ffff2346, which nonlinear_transition_controller and seven other functions read. Stored counts are retained. Physical quantities and engineering conversions are unresolved. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
