  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xCDB6" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 1 - Engine Speed Limit - Fuel Cut Curves</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x16BF4; 2 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Native VQ37 fuel-cut activation and release curves on the filtered raw oil-thermistor code; a lower code is a higher oil temperature. Common-definition Map 1 uses the canonical stock storage. Exact JK78C native fuel-cut model at 0x6aeb8; selector 0xffff10e5, shared axis 0x16a64. The BSR at coordinator instruction ordinal 28 targets FUN_0006aeb8, the third Boolean predicate aggregated by the final fuel-mask coordinator. It interpolates the adjacent activation and release curves on the shared eight-point axis, caps both results with the adjacent scalar limits, and compares them with the current native RPM word. The two rows are interpolated independently; no interpolation occurs between rows.</description>
