  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x5E63" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 3 - Fuel Compensation - Main - Default</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x1DC00; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence candidate. Fuel Compensation Map: the unsigned output is a multiplicative fuel correction with raw 128 = 100% as neutral. The result participates in calculating fuel-delivery duration and undergoes uint16 saturation. Target variant: Default. Common-definition Map 3 storage is projected from 0x9EBA. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. The machine trace establishes the multiplicative role, while A2L and homolog EV18A 0xa2f6 establish the physical name and scale with the shared layout offset of +0x5c. This is neither a lambda target nor an AFR reciprocal. Definition address projected from JK08A 0000a29a through JK08A-JK78C.definition-addresses.csv: mutual-best accessor preserves geometry axes and lookup role on the default arm of the target state selector. Static diagnostic context: Engine RPM [code, homologous_community, via axis evidence: indexed_by].</description>
