  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x6656" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 3 - Ignition Timing Surface - Cold Coolant [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x1D400; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Cold-coolant ignition surface of the mode-selected half of the ignition coordinator FUN_00069AB8, the half that stock ROM8[0x8965] = 0xBA (bit 5 set) executes. The coolant byte 0xFFFF1069 above ROM8[0x8AC1] selects the hot-coolant surface and at or below ROM8[0x8AC2] the cold-coolant surface; between the two thresholds the coordinator interpolates the low-seven fields of both surfaces. Both stock thresholds hold 120 (70 degC), so the stock image has no blend band. The low seven bits carry the timing field and bit 7 passes to the coordinator output beside it. Common-definition Map 3 storage is projected from 0xA20A. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. This view edits mask 0x7F and preserves the other bits in each cell. Exact JK78C target-native table at 0xa20a bound to accessor 0x69ab8 through literal 0x6a074, accessor 0x69ab8 through literal 0x6a198. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x-64 deg; proposed editor-grid inverse x+64. Origin: the retained layout interpretation and defs/JK08A.findings.csv:41, ignition_gated_surface_1/tbl. The canonical PID0E closure is not the executed target-native path. Equal surface bytes and a common field/coordinator role do not reproduce that complete target arithmetic and diagnostic publication. x-64 applies to the low-seven field only; applying it to the full byte would include the independent flag. This is an adjustment hypothesis, not absolute spark angle. Recorded code and catalog interpretation: Byte-identical to the 1ND0A surface 0xA510 and the 1ME3B surface 0xA444. The projected JK08A surfaces 0x95CA, 0x96CA, and 0x97CA are three byte-identical copies in the gated half of the same coordinator, which the stock configuration byte leaves unexecuted. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="16" />
